Upstream-Name: Enzan
Upstream-Contact: https://github.com/kenobi314159/Enzan-RTL-Simulator/issues
Source: https://github.com/kenobi314159/Enzan-RTL-Simulator
Comment:
 The source tarball carries NVC as a submodule and, in third_party/bundled/,
 the sources a build of Enzan would otherwise download: slang, the fmt slang
 builds, and GoogleTest. docs/third_party.md records each of them with its
 revision.

